{"id":114429159228251,"type":"album","name":"Census Designated","artist":"Jane Remover","year":2023,"weight":16,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/731948-census-designated_0005.jpg","aoty":77,"aoty_user":81,"yt":"eJkzC50mAFE","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/jane-remover/census-designated","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/731948-jane-remover-census-designated.php"},"desc":"Census Designated is the second album by American producer and singer-songwriter Jane Remover, released via deadAir records on October 20th, 2023. The album was preceded by the release of its lead single, \"Lips\", on August 23, 2023, and was announced on the same day. Initial ideas for Census Designated were written and recorded just weeks after Frailty’s release, but took 18 months to perfect. During their first trip across America, Jane collected ambience and experience that texturized the embryo of Census Designated. Jane says that a central inspiration for the new music came from an extremely dangerous drive in blizzard ."},"artist_ref":{"id":104245536290777,"name":"Jane Remover","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":8412226417108,"type":"genre","name":"Indie Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1139,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":72160633815519,"type":"genre","name":"Shoegaze","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":622,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":245950225873330,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":526,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":274490571464652,"type":"genre","name":"Noise Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":360,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":19761880143227,"type":"genre","name":"Dream Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":343,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"}],"lists":[{"id":96948353641453,"name":"Bandcamp: The Best Albums